Alphabetically

C + 3 → F;

F + 3 → I;

I + 3 → L;

L + 3 → O;

O + 3 → R;

R + 3 → U; (V is written there instead of U)

U + 3 → X;

X + 3 → A.

Hence, the wrong letter in the series is V.
